  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grassroot Football Networks Jordan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen capacity to ensure safe and inclusive football activities, through sustainable and inclusive football organisations. Ensuring opportunities for women and girls through leadership and coaching through Grassroot Football Networks. The project aims to promote social inclusion of persons with disabilities by expanding their access to and participation in sports. Persons with disabilities are among the project&apos;s target groups. The project aims to expand opportunities for refugees to benefit from and participate in sports. Refugees are among the project&apos;s target groups.</narrative>
  </description>
